9159341,2024-06-03,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Domestic (US) money transfer,Fraud or scam,,"and I am writing to request your assistance in investigating a significant financial crime that resulted in a loss of {$200000.00}. As a loyal Citibank customer and Citigold member residing in XXXX XXXX I am extremely concerned about the handling of this situation and the lack of updates I have received. 

