9181254,2024-06-05,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Getting a credit card,Application denied,"I submitted an application to AMERICAN EXPRESS on XX/XX/XXXX. On XX/XX/XXXX I received an Adverse Action Letter from them as well. The adverse action offer stated that the application was rejected.

