9190603,2024-06-07,Checking or savings account,Savings account,Managing an account,Deposits and withdrawals,"Formal Complaint Against Marcus by Goldman Sachs for Abusive Practices Dear Sir/Madam , I am writing to file a formal complaint against Marcus by Goldman Sachs due to their repeated abusive practices and gross mismanagement of my personal banking accounts, which have caused me significant distress and inconvenience. 

On multiple occasions, I have attempted to transfer funds from my Marcus account to my new bank account. However, I have encountered a frustrating and unending loop of rejections and misinformation that has spanned over three weeks. 

