The inaccuracies on my credit report are a defamation of my character and have a detrimental impact on my life. The errors have resulted in higher interest rates for refinancing my vehicle, and potential landlords have declined my rental applications. This situation is causing significant stress and preventing me from making the positive changes necessary to better my financial stability and overall quality of life.

