I kindly request that the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau investigate this matter urgently and take appropriate action to ensure that these inaccuracies are corrected promptly. I believe that adherence to 15 U.S.C. 1681 will not only rectify my current predicament but also prevent such issues from occurring in the future, thereby protecting consumers from unwarranted harm.

