9258376,2024-06-14,Debt collection,Credit card debt,Attempts to collect debt not owed,Debt was result of identity theft,"To whom it may concern : Please note that this is not a refusal to pay off the account but a notice sent as per the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( F.D.C.P.A. ), 15 U.S.C. 1692 ( G ) Section 809 ( B ). This notice states that your claim is disputed and validation of the account is required.

