9304511,2024-06-21,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"The consumer reporting agency, Experian, is required by law to maintain complete and accurate information on my credit file. The Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) requires the CRA to correct or delete the disputed item. This is outlined in Section 611 In Cases of Disputed Accuracy. 

