9313250,2024-06-20,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I want to formally address a significant issue concerning my account with XXXX XXXX XXXX, specifically a prior credit card, account # XXXX. Ive been attempting to settle this issue with XXXX XXXX and the credit reporting agencies. I have filed multiple complaints to the CFPB in good faith. 
