9318507,2024-06-21,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"In XX/XX/XXXX, I contacted Capital One to arrange a payment agreement to pay off the full balance of the business joint credit card account that was reporting on my consumer profile. At that time, the total balance owed was {$1500.00}. To resolve the outstanding balance, I entered into a payment agreement with Capital One to pay the balance in full by making a total of 10 automatic payments between XX/XX/XXXX XX/XX/XXXX of {$150.00} monthly, with the XXXX and final payment being {$150.00}, which would pay the account in full and bring the balance to XXXX. All automatic payments were completed, and the balance was paid off in full as arranged in XX/XX/XXXX. 
