Requirements : 1 ) Periodic statements including ; 2 ) the information required by section 1637 ( b ) 3 ) Notice mailed out no later than 21 days before payment due date I requested proof of the above pursuant rule 1002 For Trans Union LLC to furnish a payment as late they must have evidence of the requirements that 15 USC 1666b requires.

